sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User as User in Chrome
  participant Page as Web page
  participant Content as content-script.js
  participant Background as background.js service worker
  participant Storage as chrome.storage.local
  participant OpenRouter as OpenRouter API
  participant Panel as Side panel or fullscreen app

  User->>Page: Highlight text or choose action
  Page->>Content: Selection and page metadata available
  Content->>Content: Build page context and selected-text payload
  Content->>Background: QUEUE_PANEL_ACTION or AI_REQUEST
  Background->>Storage: Read settings, model, personality, files, history
  Background->>OpenRouter: Send prompt, context, selection, and recent history
  OpenRouter-->>Background: Return generated text and model metadata
  Background->>Storage: Store chat message and action state
  Background-->>Panel: Send response for rendering
  Panel-->>User: Show answer, citation notes, or graph preview
